---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="About — stefumies." description="About Steve Davies, software developer." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About</h1>
			<p>
				Twenty-plus years in software development, starting out in project management before
				moving fully into design and coding. Java and the JVM have been the foundation throughout —
				Spring-certified, with hands-on experience across Spring Boot, Nest, Node, React, Angular,
				AWS and GCP. Programming languages and paradigms are a genuine interest: both functional
				and more traditional approaches.
			</p>
			<p>
				The shift towards AI-first, agentic engineering is changing how software gets built — and
				for someone who has spent two decades doing it a certain way, that demands more than picking
				up a new framework. These posts are something akin to a working journal of that transition:
				what's being learned, what's being unlearned, and what's being built along the way.
			</p>
			<p>
				stefumies(at)gmail.com &middot;
				<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/stevemdavies/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
